Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Pages=20d'=C3=A9tablissement=20:=20aligne=20les?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20chiffres=20cl=C3=A9s=20sur=20la=20m=C3=AAme=20ligne?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
